OL,3,GNEWSAFund set up in memory of teen who
OL,4,Adied from cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fund has been set up by the family of
OL,7,Fa teenager who died from cancer to
OL,8,Fsupport other families with children
OL,9,Fwho are receiving treatment for the
OL,10,Fdisease.
OL,12,FMatthew's Meals and Miles will raise
OL,13,Fmoney to be donated to the Children's
OL,14,FCancer North charity, which will help
OL,15,Fwith the costs of transport, meals, and
OL,16,Faccommodation for families visiting the
OL,17,FGreat North Children's Hospital in
OL,18,FNewcastle.
