OL,3,GNEWSAFund set up in memory of teen who
OL,4,Adied from cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe initiative has been named after
OL,7,F18-year-old Matthew Hall from
OL,8,FTynemouth, who died last year from an
OL,9,Fultra-rare and incurable cancer
OL,10,Faffecting his hormone-producing cells.
OL,12,FHis mother Jane Hall said: "He would be
OL,13,Fvery proud because he had that
OL,14,Fgenerous, kind nature."
